    // own .venv (created by `uv sync`), so there is no single interpreter that resolves them
    // all. Listing every project root makes its `app` package resolve, and every project's
    // site-packages makes its third-party imports resolve; a path is simply inert until that
    // project has been synced. All 22 target Python 3.12.

